# USER's MessageBox against real 3.11: COMMDLG's overwrite question (string 257 with the path, caption
# 385, MB_YESNO | MB_ICONEXCLAMATION | MB_DEFBUTTON2: No is the default and has the focus) as
# Notepad's File > Save As asks it for C:\WINDOWS\SETUP.TXT (arch311-ref/scn/cdlg-save.scn, second
# box); Enter answers the default, No.
# regress: sh tools/run-app-test.sh apps/build/mbox "$TEST" "$OUT" 0x134 COMMDLG.DLL:385 COMMDLG.DLL:257 'C:\WINDOWS\SETUP.TXT'
